es, compact concat fallback, no-gap behavior, warnings, stoppability, missing-derivation degradation, source corruption blocking, fallback logging, and background requeue/corruption behavior.\"},{\"name\":\"Compact no-provider invariant\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json reports compact no-provider proof through full compact path with provider input capture equal to [].\",\"Gates included chunk-compact recovery tests and verify/verify-all.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Story-local requirement requires production compact path proof, and verifier confirmed the spy-provider full-path evidence.\"},{\"name\":\"Thread-view boundary\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json reports pnpm run boundaries passed and focused rg found no thread-view import of domains/turns/internal/*.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Thread-view uses the public turns surface for compact chunk material.\"},{\"name\":\"Configured story gate\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json gatesRun includes cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify: pass.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Acceptance standard requires the configured story gate to pass.\"},{\"name\":\"Regression finding SV-04-001\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json marks SV-04-001 resolved and confirms the focused TC-4.8b missing-member corruption probe passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The only prior open finding was fixed and re-verified.\"}],\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[],\"rulings\":[]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"BETWEEN_STORIES\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":null,\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":null,\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec9f6-24ea-72c3-bed0-3179062c9152\",\"storyId\":\"04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019